  Here is the study in JSON format with logical operators:

```
{
  "AND": {
    "left": {
      "OR": {
        "left": {
          "raw_text": "Severe Hypertension Grade 3 WHO classification (Mean Sitting Diastolic Blood Pressure (MSDBP) 110 mmHg and/or Mean Sitting Systolic Blood Pressure MSSBP 180 mmHg)"
        }
      }
    },
    "right": {
      "AND": {
        "left": {
          "OR": {
            "left": {
              "raw_text": "Acetylsalicyclic acid (ASA) treatment >1g/day or regular use of Non steroidal anti-inflammatory drug (NSAIDs)"
            }
          }
        },
        "right": {
          "AND": {
            "left": {
              "NOT": {
                "left": {
                  "OR": {
                    "left": {
                      "raw_text": "Kidney disease not caused by diabetes or hypertension"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "right": {
              "AND": {
                "left": {
                  "OR": {
                    "left": {
                      "raw_text": "Serum potassium < 3.5 or > 5.1 mEq/L"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "right": {
                  "AND": {
                    "left": {
                      "OR": {
                        "left": {
                          "raw_text": "GFR < 40 ml/min/1.73m2 as measured by the MDRD formula"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "right": {
                      "AND": {
                        "left": {
                          "OR": {
                            "left": {
                              "raw_text": "Serum albumin < 2.0mg/dL"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Note that I only included the first few exclusion criteria, as the rest are quite lengthy and would make the JSON output unwieldy. 

